[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4333799101","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119026#issuecomment-4333799101","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119026","id":4333799101,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAlCGvQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T09:00:56Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T09:00:56Z","body":"> Investigation and writeup drafted with assistance from Claude Sonnet 4.6; root cause confirmed and fix verified by `@bziebart123` on a deployed itch.io build before submitting.\n\nPlease do not use LLMs to write issue reports, did you use an agentive AI for this? As it mentions you which seems odd if you wrote it","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4333799101/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4336970737","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119026#issuecomment-4336970737","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119026","id":4336970737,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAoDr8Q","user":{"login":"bziebart123","id":198497440,"node_id":"U_kgDOC9TUoA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198497440?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123","html_url":"https://github.com/bziebart123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T16:00:20Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T16:00:20Z","body":"Yes apologies. I tried writing down the explanation myself and wasn't happy with it/could't do it sunccinctly. \n\nWon't do that going forward. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4336970737/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6052306127","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119026#issuecomment-6052306127","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119026","id":6052306127,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaL7czw","user":{"login":"Abdaishere","id":59124608,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTI0NjA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59124608?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdaishere","html_url":"https://github.com/Abdaishere","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdaishere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdaishere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdaishere/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdaishere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdaishere/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdaishere/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdaishere/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdaishere/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdaishere/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-08T04:33:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T04:33:35Z","body":"Same bug here on v4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]. My game adds five buses at startup with `AudioServer.add_bus(AudioServer.bus_count)` and the web export had no sound in any browser, while desktop and Android were fine. I checked which nodes were connected to `ctx.destination` while music played: on the broken build no GainNode reached it, so Master really was cut off.\n\nWorkaround until #119027 is merged: `AudioServer.bus_count = i + 1` instead of `add_bus(i)`. Sound came back on web with that change.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6052306127/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6112997108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119026#issuecomment-6112997108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119026","id":6112997108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbFzu9A","user":{"login":"GreyXor","id":79602273,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NjAyMjcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79602273?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyXor","html_url":"https://github.com/GreyXor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyXor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyXor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyXor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyXor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyXor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyXor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyXor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyXor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyXor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-11T19:45:57Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T19:45:57Z","body":"Confirming on 4.7.2.stable, Web export with variant/thread_support=false (Sample playback).\n\nMy symptom is different: sound plays, but AudioServer.set_bus_volume_db() / set_bus_mute() on my buses do nothing on the web. Desktop is fine.\n\nMy default_bus_layout.tres has Master, Music and Effects. At startup an addon (Godot Mod Player (https://bitbucket.org/arlez80/godot-mod-player-g4)) adds 33 more buses with AudioServer.add_bus(). Each addAt(-1) inserts the JS bus at length - 2, so the two arrays end up like this:\n\n- C++: Master, Music, Effects, ModMaster, Ch0 … Ch31\n- JS: Master, ModMaster, Ch0 … Ch31, Music, Effects\n\nSo the volume, mute and send calls for Music and Effects reach other JS buses. Master stays at index 0 here, which is probably why I get wrong routing instead of silence.\n\nWorkaround: I declared the addon's buses in default_bus_layout.tres, so the addon finds them and never calls add_bus(). Loading a layout doesn't go through addAt: AudioServer::set_bus_layout() calls set_sample_bus_count(), which appends the buses in order. [Volumes work again on the web with that.]\n\nSo I don't think a default_bus_layout.tres with several buses triggers this on its own (step 2 of the report). It takes a runtime add_bus(), or move_bus() (see the comment on #119027).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6112997108/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]